## HAWS GitHub Copilot adapter

Load canonical standards from `core/HAWS.md` and `core/WORK_INSTRUCTIONS.md`.
Load private preferences from the connected Second Brain:
`secondbrain/USER_PREFERENCES.md` and `secondbrain/ANTI_PATTERNS.md`.
Skills and agent roles remain in the HAWS `skills/` and `agents/` catalogs.
This adapter intentionally does not duplicate those sources.
